// The same class through a PATH expression rather than an annotation: the
// prelude's `String::clone` calls `String::with_str`, and a user enum of that
// name turns the call into a variant lookup that finds nothing.
//
// Kept beside the arity file because one shape is a lower bound - the prelude
// breaks in as many ways as it uses a name, and a fixture set that pins one way
// says nothing about the others.
enum String { A | B }

fn main() { println(1); }
